.PARAM lzth={limit(Zthtype,0,1)} 
 
X1  g dd s Tj 1 cool_800_C3 PARAMS: dVth={dVth}  act={act}  dR={dRdson} 
 +  Inn={Inn}  Unn={Unn}  Rmax={Rmax}  Rs={Rs}  heat=1 
 
