.SUBCKT SPP02N80C3 drain gate source Tj Tcase PARAMS: dVth=0 dRdson=0 Zthtype=0 
 
.PARAM Ls=7n       Lg=7n       Ld=3n       Rs=2m       Rg=1.4       
.PARAM act=2.275   Inn=1.2     Unn=10      Rmax=2.7     
.PARAM lzth={limit(Zthtype,0,1)} 
 
X1  g dd s Tj 1 cool_800_C3 PARAMS: dVth={dVth}  act={act}  dR={dRdson} 
 +  Inn={Inn}  Unn={Unn}  Rmax={Rmax}  Rs={Rs}  heat=1 
 
L_Ld         drain  dd    {Ld} 
R_Ld         drain  dd    10 
 
L_Ls         source lsrs  {Ls} 
R_Ls         source lsrs  10 
